fixture dash_cancel_latest_attack_press_wins
doc BUILD.md s5 feel rule "the buffer always stores the latest input" (movement review 5, M3). Side 1, attack (neutral) pressed on its frame 3, a dash on its frame 4 that takes that press over, then attack with the stick up on dash frame 3. On dash frame 6 the up-strike comes out: the newer press replaces the one the dash took over, which used to win with its old stick.
room test/flat
spawn 200 544
frames 40
input
  0 attack
  2 attack
  3 R dash
  4 R
  5 U attack
  6..7
end
expect
  at 0 event.attack=1 action=side1
  at 3 event.dash=1
  at 8 event.attack=1 action=up
  never 9..39 event.attack=1
end
